& [SJS]
  + Situation: proof-bearing SOP discovery is now model-callable but the three compiler outputs remain architectural prose without one common machine-checkable planning seam
  + Justification: pure inert forms expose identity capability source-map backend-separation and successor-recognition faults before any artifact or effect path exists
  + Solution: add one cantor_core module containing strict forms domain-separated digests whole-form validators and fixtures only

& [Delineation]
  + this slice describes and validates candidate metadata; it does not parse SOP lower semantic meaning build artifacts invoke toolchains or execute candidates
  + InferenceHostIntegration identifies both preferred external adapters and a possible internal addon profile but grants neither
  + NativeArtifact identifies conventional outputs and no FPGA implementation
  + AttentionProcedure identifies an explicit host-orchestrated procedure and no hidden attention access

& [Reuse]
  + reuse ContentDigest SemanticId SemanticAddress and closed serde machine-form conventions from cantor_core
  + do not reinterpret existing CantorProcessIr or procedure receipts as the whole multi-backend IR
  + source-map records point to exact proof-bearing SemanticAddress values rather than filenames alone

& [DataDecision]
  + one seed maps each of exactly three backend kinds to one versioned profile
  + one IR node has a typed role optional type reference exact semantic address dependencies and generated-derivation evidence when applicable
  + one plan selects exactly one backend and one capability subset
  + one receipt accounts admitted and denied capability sets but remains non-authorizing
  + one ledger observes monotonic maturity and makes external successor recognition explicit

& [HonestyAndSecurity]
  + forms carry fixed non-authority statements and no field named signature can be treated as private signing material
  + missing unresolved or cyclic semantic dependencies prevent a valid IR
  + backend profile substitution and capability ceiling excess fail closed
  + successor recognition requires independent Honesty Security and external recognition references

& [Disposition]
  + [status] ready_for_exact_Slice1_phase_lock
  + [still_locked] all compilation lowering artifact effect model host remote hardware and deployment behavior
